# Build output
build/
build-asan/
build-tsan/
build-prof/
*.o
*.obj

# Runtime save states / recorded-input files - these are per-player session
# data (a save's contents depend on exactly where a specific person stopped
# playing a specific copy of a ROM), not source, and are generated next to
# whatever ROM path the emulator was launched with.
*.sav
*.inputs.txt

# Ad-hoc debugging scratch (old screenshots/logs from investigating a bug
# live in the project directory instead of a proper scratch/tmp location) -
# not part of the emulator itself.
scratch/
trace.log

# NES ROM files (.nes) are almost always copyrighted commercial game data,
# not something this repository has the right to redistribute - anyone
# using this emulator needs to supply their own legally-obtained ROM (e.g.
# dumped from a cartridge they own). This is the same norm every emulator
# project follows.
#
# The one exception is nestest.nes/nestest.log (tests/nestest/) - that's a
# freely-distributed 6502 conformance test ROM from the NES homebrew/dev
# community (see https://www.nesdev.org/wiki/Emulator_tests), not a
# commercial game, and is explicitly un-ignored below so `tests/nestest_check`
# keeps working for anyone who clones this repo.
*.nes
!tests/nestest/nestest.nes
docs/
!tests/roms/*.nes
__pycache__/
*.pyc
